     "say": {
      "en": "Two partners each withdraw 60,000 rupees in a year, one at the start of each month, the other at the end. Should both pay the same interest? Interest on drawings depends on how long the money was out of the business. In this lesson: Calculate interest on drawings by the average period method."
     }
